[sai-00199] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: For clinical care plan generation, perform a 'Clinical Rubric-to-Diagnosis' mapping before drafting. Create a checklist that explicitly assigns each required nursing diagnosis to its mandatory components: 1) Outcome, 2) Four specific assessment parameters (e.g., vital signs, pain quality, lab markers, neurovascular status), and 3) Four specific interventions (e.g., hand hygiene, aseptic technique, safety/education, administrative documentation). Do not proceed to drafting until every diagnosis has a fully populated set of these requirements to ensure the plan is clinically robust and rubric-compliant.
