[sai-00217] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When a prompt includes a detailed rubric, perform a 'Rubric-to-Structure' mapping before drafting. Create a checklist of every mandatory field (e.g., assessor details, workstation location, source citations) and every required response option (e.g., Yes/No/NA). Verify the final output against this checklist to ensure 100% compliance with the 'Definition of Done'.
