[sai-00239] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When a prompt requests a technical compliance document based on specific standards (e.g., WCAG, GDPR, HIPAA), treat the rubric as a mandatory technical specification. Do not provide high-level summaries. You must explicitly map and detail every core principle (e.g., the four POUR principles for accessibility), specific technical thresholds (e.g., contrast ratios, media captioning requirements), and editorial constraints. Perform a 'Technical-Requirement-Audit' before drafting to ensure the output contains the granular, actionable data required for professional compliance.
