[misc-00003] helpful=3 harmful=0 :: For multi-criteria sampling tasks, create a systematic mapping table or logic flow to ensure every constraint is satisfied. Verify that the final selection covers all required categories (e.g., specific entities, risk weightings, and business lines) before finalizing the 'Sample' column.
[misc-00006] helpful=5 harmful=0 :: For research-based tasks, default to APA citation style (Author, A. A. (Year). Title. Journal.) unless otherwise specified. When a Word document format is requested, structure the content with clear headings and table layouts that are optimized for direct copy-pasting into a document processor.
[misc-00015] helpful=37 harmful=0 :: When a prompt requests a document (e.g., .docx, tool, or report), prioritize structural formatting such as clear headings, table layouts, and consistent numbering. This ensures the output is ready for professional document processing and avoids the need for manual reformatting.